window.products.push({"id":258015,"name":"MCombo Big Kids Recliner Chair with Cup Holders for Toddler Boys and Girls, 2 Side Pockets, 3+ Age Group, Faux Leather 7322 (Dark Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pAyplXUyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Suitable for Big Kids (1-4): If you are trying to find something a little bigger than normal kids recliner and this one is perfect. (Recommended Height: 31\" -47\") Safer & Easier: The whole chair is tested by ASTM standard. Anti-slip feet increase stability and make it safer for children to climb up and down on the chair. The toddler can easily master the way to use the chair and change the position of the chair by themselves to exercise their independence. 2 Cupholders & 4 Pockets: Keep your kids’ favorite toy and books close by with 2 cup holders and 2 side & front pockets. They can read, eat snacks and watch TV on their own furniture with much entertainment to spare the leisure time. Clean Easily & Soft Padding: The chair features high-quality material not only skin-friendly, but also can be easily cleaned with a dry or damp lint-free cloth, which provides the chair with excellent comfort and durability. The soft padding makes the child feel like being in the mother's arms when sitting on the chair. Perfect Gift: Whether your little one is a boy or a girl, they will be thrilled to have their own recliner! The simple and exquisite outer box allows children to know that it belongs to them when they see the box. Contemporary design and stylish colors are suitable for any home decoration, such as your child's room, living room and bedroom. Warm Tips: The chair reclines up to 130 degrees, it does not recline all the way to flat position. If you any questions about this chair, please feel free to contact us and we will help you immediately and do out beat to provide you with a most satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pAyplXUyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MCombo","source_asin":"B08W3HFHLP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W3HFHLP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W3HFHLP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
