window.products.push({"id":258057,"name":"SICSMIAO Projection Alarm Clock, Digital Alarm Clock for Bedrooms, 180° Projector with Radio, Sunrise Clock, Dual Alarms with USB Chargers, 7 Color Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JG4uQXw3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎥【New Updated Clear Ceiling Projection Alarm Clock】: Alarm clock with 180°adjustable projector allows to project a soft red color time onto ceiling or wall. With 3 level brightness projection view adjustable, It is very clear to view but will not disturb you when sleeping. You can simply glance at the ceiling and see the time when lying on bed. Projection can be set auto timing function, automatically turn on at night 10PM and turn off at day 8AM, it's very convenient and energy saving. 💡【Sunrise Wake-up Light】: Sunrise alarm clock offers a gradually increasing light 30 mins before your pre-set alarm time. The light brightness will be on from 1% to 100% at set time to bring you out of deep sleep gently to welcome a refreshed day. 7 colors light are suitable for different occasions such as night light, reading light or atmosphere light. You can use the independent rotary button to adjust the brightness of the night light, total 30 level brightness adjustment. ⏰【Dual Alarms with Snooze Function】: Dual alarms makes it possible to set two separate wake-up times and 4 alarm repeat modes perfect for weekday and weekends. 7 alarm ringtone can be choose from, S01-S05 built-in alarm ringtones, S06 U-disk stored your own sound use as ringtone or sleep white noise, S07 is used the FM radio as the ringtone. 7 alarm sounds can satisfy all your needs. Snooze function gives you 9 extra minutes of sleep before alerting you again, total is allows for 5 times. 📻【FM Radio & U-disk & Night Light with Sleep Timer】: FM radio alarm clock scan and saved radio frequencies automatically. With a 60-inch antenna is attached for better signal reception. You can play the music in your U-disk stored as lullaby for you to fall in sleep with sweet dream. The sleep timer function give the sound & light within 90 minutes for your sleep. Sound & light will automatically turn off after the specified time. NOTE: This clock do not feature with the AM-RADIO function. 🤝【Dual USB Charging Ports & Battery Backup】: With two 5V/2A USB output interfaces, allowing 2 devices to be charged at the same time while you sleeping at night. AC power for night light, time projection, FM radio, U-disk, alarm, time display functions, while backup battery (built-in the clock's internals, it is invisible) for maintaining the settings in case of power outages. (NOTE: We support 30-days refund policy, 3-months replacement, 24-hours friendly customer service.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JG4uQXw3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sicsmiao","source_asin":"B0897SM5X3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0897SM5X3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0897SM5X3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
