window.products.push({"id":258076,"name":"Mini Bag Sealer Portable Chargeable Sealing Machine ,2 in 1 Rechargeable Handheld Heat Sealer for Chip Bags, Plastic Bags, Snack Bags ,Freshness Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YwuJPl7MS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"It's a good choice for Picnic, BBQ, travel or gift giving. Best gifts for your mother, friends and families. How to Use: Charge it until the light turns green. Press the button to turn it on and start to work. Press the button and hold for 3-5 seconds to heat up for work. Put the opened bag in the middle of the sealer and slowly pull it at a constant speed. For better results, the seal can be repeated multiple times.  If the bag is too thick, try to swipe slowly, or warm up for a few more seconds. How to use the cutter ? Step 1: Please take out cutter from below sealer. Step 2: Open a small hole first with the cutter in the bags. Step 3: Pinch the open in end of the bags, then meanwhile glide sideways with cutter. Warm Tips 1. The heat sealer can be use for plastic bag of PP/PE/PVC, snack bag, chip bag, pet food bag, film-covered bag and son on. Not suitable for pure paper bag, pure aluminium bag and super thick bag.  2. The swiping speed of the sealer depends on the thickness of the plastic bag, you need to swipe quickly for the thinner bag, and swipe slowly for the thick bag.  3. Please turn off the power after use.  4. Please keep away from the kids. Package: 1 x Mini Sealing Machine 1 x USB Charging Cable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YwuJPl7MS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMOEJOV","source_asin":"B099KDRJ8B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258076","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099KDRJ8B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099KDRJ8B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
