window.products.push({"id":258184,"name":"Ceramic Butter Dish with Lid and Knife, Gencywe Large Butter Container Keeper Storage, Airtight Silicone Butter Holder, Kitchen Butter Dish with Lid f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A4mZXcyyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Upgraded Version】- Butter dish with lid and butter curler knife. The butter dish with lid has a groove that perfectly fits the knife, integrating the butter knife, and butter box. The small slot hole on it can curl the hard butter to put on the bread. This butter spread knife is even safely for children to fill their toast with butter or chocolate curls. Don't worry about not having a butter knife when you want to cut some butter. 【Super Capacity & Cutting Board Lid】- 4.2 x 6.2inch upgraded super capacity which is wide and deep enough to fit a wide range of shaped sticks of butter, this butter dish with lid can hold at least two pieces of butter and most butter brands can be applied. Don't dirty your cutting board to slice butter when our butter dishes already have one built in! Just take the bamboo lid off and use it to cut butter to your heart's content. 【Excellent Freshnes】- The bamboo cover with an upgraded double silicone seal helps to keep your butter stick fresh in the refrigerator and uncontaminated from other flavors in the same area, bring you the fun of enjoying food. Our bamboo cover material is very hard and thick, it will not easy to age and damage, the blade on the groove of the butter cover is made of stainless steel to protect the health of you and your family. 【Safe and Easy To Clean】- Our butter containers use safe and harmless Pro-grade non-stick porcelain. The ceramic design makes this butter dish with lid easier to clean, you can simply rinse the ceramic container with water or put it in the dishwasher to clean. Plus, it is microwaveable and refrigerator and freezer safe. 【Versatile】- This is a multifunctional butter container, you can also use it to store other ingredients such as biscuits, nuts, seasonings, etc. At the same time, it is also a great kitchen decoration. With the simple and atmospheric design, high-end quality, exquisite and unique kraft paper packaging, this butter dish is a ideal gift that can improve family life quality and enhance happiness sense!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A4mZXcyyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gencywe","source_asin":"B0B5R3F5KZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5R3F5KZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5R3F5KZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
