window.products.push({"id":258279,"name":"Wallniture Lyon Hanging Pot Rack for Kitchen Organization and Storage, Black Kitchen Utensil Holders with 20 S Hooks for Hanging Pots and Pans Set, 17","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LfAFXocxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Functional & Stylish Kitchen Storage: Lyon wall organizer and storage rack will help you keep your kitchen essentials always accessible! Hang your measuring cups, mandolins, zesters to the hooks that easily slide. Keep your utensils where you can easily reach while upgrading our farmhouse kitchen decor Coffee Mug Holder Station: Don't wait to make your own coffee corner! You can hang your mugs over your coffee machine to create a modern decoration in your kitchen bar! Your colorful coffee mugs ortea cups will look nice out on display! Sturdy Kitchen Rail: The 17 inches rail is outstanding with its durability and sturdy construction that prevents the hooks from swaying or falling off! Store up to 15 lbs if mounted on to drywall with included metal anchors and screws. If directly mounted on to the tile or brick wall with included plastic anchors and screws, capacity can go up to 25 lbs Multi-Functional Organizer: Lyon kitchen rods for wall can help you with endless possibilities. You can use them as kitchen storage for cooking utensils, as a bathroom organizer to hang your towels, or in your office for hanging coats, bags and keys. Also, it can be a perfect rack for hanging awards and medals Easy Installation: Lyon wall storage rack set of 2 comes with all necessary accessories, so you can directly start installation once you have received the package. You don't have to spend hours to install it, just follow the instructions, your rack will be ready to use in a few minutes!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LfAFXocxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wallniture","source_asin":"B07Z8HZ8NY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z8HZ8NY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z8HZ8NY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":258280,"name":"TEEBIM Teacher Gifts For Women - Teacher Appreciation Gifts - Cool Gifts for Teachers Women - New Teacher Gifts - Teacher Birthday Gifts - Big Heart T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7196-ISxqqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TEACHER GIFTS FOR WOMEN - Teaching is a hard work, need patience and love. Our tumbler is a teacher must-have item, which can be a perfect thank you gift for teachers or a meaningful gift for new teachers from students. These lovely teacher tumblers will for sure put a smile on your favorite teacher's face and make a touching inspirational gift to new teacher, kindergarten teacher, daycare teacher, preschool teacher, elementary teacher, special eduation teacher, assistant principal, etc. UNIQUE TEACHER APPRECIATION GIFTS - Students could celebrate the teacher appreciation week or say thanks to their beloved teachers at the end or the beginning of the school year by giving this appreciation gift tumbler. The teacher coffee cup with the motivational quote \"It takes a big heart to help shape little minds\" would show how much you appreciate them. This is not only perfect thank you gifts for teachers but also retirement gifts or farewell gifts for teacher. SUITABLE FOR ANY OCCASION - This funny teacher gift will surely bring your teacher the sweetest surprise when opened, make her feel happiness and love on many special days. Ideal for the First day of school, Back to school, Teacher Appreciation Week, New School Day, Gift for Teacher's Birthday, Teacher Graduation Gifts, Christmas Gifts, End of The Year Teacher Gifts, Teacher Retirement Gifts for Women or other school seasons. PREMIUM QUALITY - This funny teacher gifts for women are made with the highest quality - 18/8 stainless steel, so this tumbler is durable, unbreakable, rust-resistant, being dishwasher safe and guaranteed to withstand the test of time. DOUBLE-WALLED INSULATION - Featuring a leakproof cap and made from food-grade stainless steel and BPA-free components, our double-wall vacuum insulated mug can keep your beverages hot or cold, at just the right temperature for hours without affecting your drink’s natural taste, which allows you to enjoy every sip!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7196-ISxqqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEEBIM","source_asin":"B0C3D6N6DK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3D6N6DK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3D6N6DK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
