window.products.push({"id":258355,"name":"Fashion Bed Group Sanford Headboard, Queen, Matte Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":258.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41f95o-0EdL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Sanford, and its defining characteristics, allows for the option of having a headboard that can act as the focal point or background décor. Constructed of carbon steel for stability and years of everyday use, the 52.25-inch headboard is detailed with castings and round finial posts. The Matte Black powder coat application finish marries texture to the surface in a way that mutes and plays with light. The (5) castings locked in place on this headboard are intentionally finished in the same black powder coat to show only their silhouette and accentuate their simple nature. A good ornamental headboard, like the Sanford, will fuse with the surrounding décor, accent other bedroom furniture and transform an ordinary room into something interesting and sophisticated. This unit includes a headboard panel, instruction sheet, and hardware bag with everything needed for easy assembly. The Leggett & Platt Sanford Headboard comes with a 10-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41f95o-0EdL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B076BD2W38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076BD2W38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076BD2W38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":258356,"name":"Pawque Sherpa Fleece Weighted Blanket 60 x 80 Inches 15lbs for Adult, Thick Fuzzy Bed Throw with Ribbed Stripes, Dual Sided Cozy Fluffy Weighted Blank","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KJW4SyLaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Weighted Blanket: Pawque striped Sherpa weighted blanket is made of 240gsm flannel with newest ribbed stripes. Layered texture offers a smooth velvety touch with ultimate gentleness and warmth. 220gsm same-color Sherpa reverse is super fluffy and cloud-soft with multiple levels of cozy softness. Sleeping and napping in its snuggles gives a breezy feel like in the gentlest embraces Sweet Sleep Companion: Our Sherpa weighted blanket with the perfect amount of pressure evenly helps you feel sure and reliable, calm your nerves, and induce quiet sleep, so you’ll drift off in deep and restful sleep and wake up full of spirit in the morning. The blanket offers hug-like comfort to make you feel warm, cozy and comfortable. It’s also a wonderful gift idea for lovers, family, and friends.Suitable for Valentine's Day, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Christmas. Improved 7 Layer Design: 7 layer design features top-grade ceramic beads in the center sealed tight under non-glue polyester padding and high-count brushed polyester layers, and shelled by fuzzy fleece and Sherpa on the outside, so that the beads won’t cluster, move, make noise, or come out to deliver the best sleep experience. Smaller grids sewn with sturdy stitches fix the beads in place so that the weight is evenly distributed to conform to your body and never leak beads Ideal Size For You: We recommend you choose a weighted blanket weighs about 8% - 15% your body weight. The 15 lbs weighted blanket is for adults between 110 -180 lbs, 20 lbs weighted blanket for adults over 150 lbs. If you are an adult over 100 lbs, we suggest you use this blanket alone. In case it’s the first time you use a weighted blanket, start off with a lighter one and you will enjoy its full benefit within a week Machine washable & 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed: Considering the blanket is heavier than regular ones, wash it in a commercial washer with warm or cold water, dry clean or spot clean is also recommended. We value our customers and take it as our honor to offer the best shopping experience. Every customer is granted with the most friendly American local service team and lifetime warranty against product defects","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KJW4SyLaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pawque","source_asin":"B0972KF621","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0972KF621","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0972KF621","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
