window.products.push({"id":258517,"name":"The Bill of Rights Replica of Historical Document Genuine Parchment and Quill Custom Made Real Wood Dark Mahogany with Black Trim Frame (18 1/4 x 25 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W6irgOYRL._AC_.jpg","description":"A lovely framed American History Memorabilia for someone special, or a perfect present for any age or taste! Each hand-finished genuine parchment is carefully mounted on a sturdy mat board to keep it flat and smooth, and then framed just for you. The solid wood frame comes with a metal sawtooth hanger, clear round bumpers on the back of the frame to protect walls from scratches and dents, and is ready to be hung. The only thing you need is space on the wall. Shop Accent Piece’s large crafted store collection to decorate, accessorize and personalize your home, office, or place of business today. Add something special to a blank wall or any space that needs a lift. Framed prints remain in good condition for years to come. The Bill of Rights is one of the four most famous documents in the U.S. history. The Bill of Rights is the name by which the first ten amendments to the U.S. Constitution are known. They were introduced by James Madison to the First U.S. Congress in 1789 as a series of legislative articles, and came into effect as Constitutional Amendments on December 15, 1791, through the process of ratification by three-fourths of the States. This beautiful 3-D presentation display features an original hand-finished genuine parchment, dense multi-layer picture mounting with custom carved matting design and a writing quill. It is showcased in a double mat, professionally framed in a real wood frame and topped with premium clear framing acrylic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W6irgOYRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Historical Documents","source_asin":"B001LYQE6I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001LYQE6I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001LYQE6I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
