window.products.push({"id":258634,"name":"VHC Brands Dakota Star Standard Sham 21x27 Country Patchwork Design, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714LIY79+xL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton SIZE: The Dakota Star Standard Sham is 21 inches wide by 27 inches long. Shams are sold individually. COUNTRY PATCHWORK DESIGN: Traditional style that compliments any country, rustic, or Americana home. Dakota Star features country black and tan in a traditional patchwork check, plaid, and appliqued star design. Reverses to solid tan. PREMIUM CONSTRUCTION: Our heirloom-quality pieces are built to last for years to come. Our 100% cotton traditional patchwork sham is expertly crafted in India using a unique yet durable stitch in the ditch and echo hand-quilting technique. Quilted shams offer 100% cotton batting fill. Tie closure. COORDINATES AVAILABLE: Pair this sham with pieces from our entire Dakota Star collection for a complete look. Available in quilts and bedding accessories. EASY CARE: machine wash, tumble dry low, iron safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714LIY79+xL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VHC Brands","source_asin":"B09PC9P5SD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PC9P5SD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PC9P5SD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":258635,"name":"Baire Bottles 8 oz Empty Clear Plastic Spice Jars Shaker Lids 6 Pk Sifter Shaker Holes and Pour Open Sides Sealed for Freshness Liners BPA Free Waterp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sGEq2EvAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Organization and Uniformity - If you demand organization this is an affordable and practical way to tidy-up your Kitchen, Pantry or Craft Area and get rid of the clutter. Re-bottle those mismatched, off-the-shelf manufacturer's spice, herbs and seasoning containers with a set of matching refillable 8 oz plastic spice containers. Perfect size for your homemade spice blends, rubs and dried herbs. Beyond the Kitchen use for Storage in your bath for bath salts, in Craft Room and in your Classroom. Economical - Stretch your dollars by purchasing large economy size spices and seasoning products to use in these refillable seasoning shaker bottles in your kitchen and pantry areas. Choose spice shakers with holes and lids for spices and seasoning. Perfect Size - This PET jars 8 oz spice shaker is lightweight and easy-to-handle in your kitchen. The empty shakers for spices will hold 8 fluid ounces (not 8 ounces of weight) which is equal to one cup and is a good hold-in-your-hand size container. They are large enough to store a generous amount of product for convenience in cooking and use in kitchen for spice and herb bottles. DIY Products - Choose to enhance the look of your handcrafted spices, rubs, herbs and other blends with these affordable clear shaker spice containers. Kick-it-up a notch and enhance the spice shaker bottles by adding the waterproof labels when crafting gifts or marketing to your customers. High Quality - Store and Dispense Your Spices and Herbs in a High Quality plastic spice bottles that will provide you with functionality in your kitchen. Use for BBQ, camping spices, plastic spice shaker, rub shaker, seasoning bottles, fish breading and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sGEq2EvAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baire Bottles","source_asin":"B07HGD29K1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HGD29K1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HGD29K1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
