window.products.push({"id":258708,"name":"B FSOBEIIALEO Storage Ottoman Cube, Toy Chest Folding Foot Rest Seat, Linen Grey 12.6\"X12.6\"X12.6\" (2 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DLsOtLzkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIZE: 12.6\"x12.6\"x12.6\", can afford 110kg/250lbs. Foldable side: 12.6'x12.6'x2.2\". MEATRIAL: Super thick high density fiber board, linen material, filled with high rebound sofa sponge, Super memory, more environmentally friendly and soft FUNCTIONAL: Fashion design, Can be used at home as a cube ottoman/footrest stool/coffee table, also can be used outdoor as a camping or fishing stool, lightweight and foldable HIDDEN STORAGE SPACE: store magazines, books, pillows, throws, TV remotes, blankets and so on, de-clutter your living room or bedroom. FOLDABLE & EASY TO ASSEMBLE: Setup only takes seconds. Unfolding, position base piece and cover. It’s lightweight folding design allows you to store this ottoman away when not in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DLsOtLzkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"B FSOBEIIALEO","source_asin":"B081CKQM4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081CKQM4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081CKQM4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":258709,"name":"Wilton Excelle Elite Round Cake Pan, Create Delicious Cakes, Mouthwatering Quiches and More in this Even-Heating, Heavy-Duty Non-Stick Cake Pan, Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411GCCF7F2L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Everyday bakers and cake decorators alike will love this Wilton 9-inch round cake pan for years to come. Baking is a piece of cake with our go-to round non-stick cake pan. Built from sturdy steel, its non-stick surface allows for easy release and minimal cleanup. Wide handles are suitable for gripping with oven mitts. This pan measures 1.5 x 10.1 x 11.3 inches and the size is stamped right on the handle making your time in the kitchen more enjoyable, no need to guess if the pan is the right size for your recipe. Our professional pans are a no-brainer for great results for pastry chefs or home bakers. With this pan you’re ready for all those birthdays, holidays, parties and guests. Be as creative as you like and use it for baking dinner or casseroles. Wilton helps families celebrate! We inspire the joy of creativity in everyone, everywhere, every day. Since 1929, Wilton has been helping home bakers and cake decorators all over the world create sweet treats and beautiful desserts by giving them the tools to make it fun and easy. The Wilton name is known around the world for cake decorating, candy making, bakeware and party products. At Wilton, we're passionate about bringing the love of baking and decorating to every consumer. Amazon.com Avid bakers will find plenty of reasons to appreciate Wilton's Excelle Elite baking tools. Designed to be hardworking, dependable, and versatile, the line combines high-quality materials with thoughtful details to impress even exacting chefs. This 9-inch round pan is one of the collection's most handy members, perfect for making anything from cakes and brownies to potato, fish, and pasta dishes in its straight, 1-1/2-inch sides. The sturdy steel warms rapidly and consistently, aided by its dark color that absorbs heat, to encourage uniformly hot insides and light browning on crusts and toppings. Cast from a single mold, the pan holds its shape and strength, avoiding the bends and twists that can occur in lightweight or lesser quality metals. A reinforced nonstick coating streamlines baking by eliminating the need to oil or line the pan and smoothly releasing food onto a cooling rack or serving platter. Large, contoured handles offer plenty of room for oven mitts and textured grip areas for transporting. An especially helpful addition, the pan's dimensions are engraved right into the handles so a busy baker can find out the size at a glance-a saving grace when it's buried deep in a crowded drawer. The pan is also dishwasher-safe and comes with a 10-year warranty against defects. A tasty recipe is included. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411GCCF7F2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilton","source_asin":"B07CLCGSLY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CLCGSLY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CLCGSLY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":258710,"name":"Purity Home 100% Cotton Sheets for Queen Size Bed – 400 Thread Count Percale Weave Cooling Sheets – 4-Piece Queen Bed Sheet Set – Hotel Luxury Deep Po","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wBMIlbdjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERCALE WITH SUBTLE SOFTNESS: Wrap yourself in these 100% Cotton sheets that gives comfort like world class hotel suits. Crisp Cool Comfortable, best quality & opulence set our sheet set in a class above the rest. Beautifully elegant yet durable, their softness gets enhanced with each washing. Bring Cool & Crisp luxury to your bedroom & feel relaxed & enjoy the comfort of hundred percent cotton sheets at a modest price. The set is available in 4 sizes Twin, Full, Queen & King PATENTED FITTED SHEET: True Grip Patented Fitted sheet fits mattresses from 7 to 18\". It is patented technology for fitted sheet where 1” wide boxer elastic on the edges of fitted sheet along with ½” elastic on drop of the fitted sheets to provide snug fit. This ensures your sheets stays in place with varying depths of mattress. Slip into Luxury exceptionally smooth & soft to touch, the 400 Thread Count sheet set is woven from the finest cotton fibres allowing you to relax into its cool comfort. CLASSIC TAILORED SET INCLUDES: Queen Size Sheet Set includes a flat sheet of 92\" width x 102\" length, fitted sheet of 60\" width x 80\" length + 16\" which fits up to 18\" Mattress and 2 Pillowcases of 20\" width x 30\" length. There is a 4 inch Z hem on the pillows and flat sheet. Accurate craftsmanship and expertly woven to produce super soft luxurious feel. Special finishing process to accentuate the softness of the fabric. High quality color dyes for safety & long lasting color fastness. CERTIFICATION: This Sheet Set is MADE IN GREEN certified. MADE IN GREEN by OEKO-TEX is a traceable product label that applies exclusively to textiles made with materials tested for harmful substances, made in environmentally friendly facilities and in safe, socially responsible workplaces. Made in a vertically integrated factory certified for ISO-9001:2008, ISO-14001:2004 & ISO-18001:2007. SEDEX, OEKO-TEX and BSCI. We believe in delivering nothing less than the best quality for our customers. YOUR TRUST-OUR ASSURANCE: Each piece is individually inspected for defect free product. A class of Elegant rich quality Cotton Sheet Set which can be used for the Master Bedroom, Charming Guest room, Hotel Suite Room and even Hospital Room; Available at a very reasonable price. Machine Wash, Tumble Dry, Do not Bleach, Do not Dry Clean, Warm Iron when Needed, Do not iron on Elastic portion. Percale weave tends to soften up with washing, so allow the sheets a few washes to experience the softness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wBMIlbdjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Purity Home","source_asin":"B0C69WX7V8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C69WX7V8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C69WX7V8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
