window.products.push({"id":258794,"name":"Alarm Clock for Heavy Sleepers Adults, 8.7'' Large Led Digital Mirror Alarm Clock with USB Charger, Vibrating Alarm Clock with Bed Shaker, Battery Bac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611ebh122tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【8.7 INCH LARGE MIRROR SURFACE】ROCAM combines a makeup mirror with a large time display alarm clock. The 8.7 inch large size LED display ensure the time is easy to see even for impaired vision people. Also, its HD mirror surface can be a makeup mirror to map your beauty while reading the time. The mirror alarm clock is perfect for desk, bedside and living room. 【STRONG BED SHAKER + LOUD BUZZ】 The vibrating alarm clock has 3 wake-up modes (loud buzz/super shaker/buzz and shaker) to choose. The 6.6ft long cord of bed shaker provides more freedom when placing it. Even if you are a heavy sleeper, the super bed shaker and loud buzz can still easily wake you up on time, perfect for the heavy sleepers, hearing impaired, deaf or hearing loss. 【7 LEVELS BRIGHTNESS & VOLUME】The bed shaker alarm clock provides 7-level brightness for you to choose. It’s needless to worry that it would be too bright to sleep or too dark to read time. This loud alarm clock for heavy sleepers has 7 levels of alarm volume for your option too ( 92dB-110dB ). It provides so many choices for the elderly, adults, women, teens, boys, girls, kids or the sight-restricted person. 【SNOOZE MODE + DUAL ALARM SETTING】 Our \"SNOOZE\" button is bigger than average and you just need to press the big \"SNOOZE\" button at the top of the desk clock to get extra 9 minutes sleep(can repeat up to 9 times). Considering to that you might need an extra alarm to remind you of something or wake up your family members, we have dual alarms for you, one for you and the other for your families. 【DC ADAPTER INCLUDED & USB PORT】Normally you need to pay $10 to order an adapter separately. Which is inconvenient and costly so we specially attach an American standard adapter into the package to save your money and time. This plug in bedside clock is also equipped with a convenient USB output port allowing you to charge your cellphone, tablets and other electronics devices simultaneously without plug in wall. The alarm clock with USB charger port is perfect for bedrooms, living room, office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611ebh122tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROCAM","source_asin":"B0C4YQGN51","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4YQGN51","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4YQGN51","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
