window.products.push({"id":258860,"name":"Hamsa Hand - Zamak Cast Metal - Handmade Blue Glass Evil Eye Bead Wall or Door Hanging Decor - Turkish Greek Ojo Turco Nazar Protection Amulet Ornamen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819fzbxG9xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Zamak Cast Metal FATIMA HAND and Hand made EVİL EYE BEAD WALL HANGING DECORAt almost every stage of human history, people have looked for the assistance of magic objects to defy evil forces. ✮ Hamsa's hand becomes a talisman that has been believed to bring luck to its owners for centuries and to give them the virtues of patience and loyalty. ✮ This ornament is expected to protect you from \"evil eyes\". ✮ The evil eye is a look that is believed by many cultures to be able to cause injury or bad luck for the person at whom it is directed for reasons of envy or dislike. ✮ The term also refers to the power attributed to certain persons of inflicting injury or bad luck by such an envious or ill-wishing look. ✮ The \"evil eye\" is also known as \"Hayn al-hased\" and \"mal de ojo.\" The idea expressed by the term causes many cultures to pursue protective measures against it. ✮ Evil eye tradition has 3000 years of history. The concept and its significance vary widely among different cultures, primarily the Middle East. ✮ The idea appears several times in translations (Tirgumim) of the Old Testament.It was a widely extended belief between many Mediterranean tribes and cultures: It started in Classical Greece and later passed to ancient Rome. ✮ Blue evil eye glass wall hanging items are also used to guard individuals and corporations against financial losses or poor business dealings. ✮ They are often displayed in shops, houses, and even on vehicles.It's believed that some people have power in their looks that can harm other people, domestic animals, goods, and properties. Dimensions:Glass evil eye bead: 1.9'' inches.Total length: 8.9'' inches.Weight: 0.15 lb.HANDMADE If you have any problems about our products, please feel free to contact us at any time, we will try our best to help you, thanks in advance!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819fzbxG9xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"supers","source_asin":"B08PVQGSQR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-258860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PVQGSQR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PVQGSQR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
